Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.84,0:22:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,...ilkokulu da sayarsak 4. defa {again need HALP}{seems ok to me tho}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.44,0:22:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ne zaman gelmek isterseniz kapım size açık.
